          </div>

          <p>
            Every model in the table uses LFP (lithium iron phosphate) cells, which is the chemistry you want for a battery that might sit in a closet for a year and then get cycled daily during an outage. LFP tolerates thousands of cycles and runs cooler than the older NMC packs that EcoFlow and its rivals used a few years ago. Specs in this guide come from EcoFlow's published figures, not from our own bench tests, and we round where EcoFlow rounds.
          </p>

          <p>
            If you are not sure whether you want EcoFlow at all, our <a href="/best-portable-power-station/">portable power station rankings</a> compare it against Jackery, Anker SOLIX and Bluetti across every size class, and our head-to-head <a href="/ecoflow-vs-jackery/">EcoFlow vs Jackery</a> covers the brand question directly. This page assumes you have already decided on EcoFlow and want the right model.
          </p>
